# The Lichess puzzle database. 304MB compressed, 1.1GB open, CC0, and an
# authoring input rather than site content: tools/build_puzzles.mjs cuts it
# down to the few hundred per theme that ship. Stream it instead of keeping it:
#   curl -L https://database.lichess.org/lichess_db_puzzle.csv.zst \
#     | zstd -dc | node tools/build_puzzles.mjs
lichess_db_puzzle.csv
lichess_db_puzzle.csv.zst
